@startuml ssd-us042
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Weather Person" as WP
participant ":AISafe System" as System

activate WP

WP -> System : requestImportWeatherData()
activate System
System --> WP : show existing air control areas + supported sources (CSV file, Open-Meteo API)
deactivate System

WP -> System : selectTargetArea(area)
activate System
System --> WP : ask for source type and its input
deactivate System

WP -> System : provideSource(sourceType, input = file or day/time window)
activate System
System --> WP : request confirmation (preview record count)
deactivate System

WP -> System : confirm()
activate System
note right of System
  Read source (parse the file, or grid the
  area box and sample the API) -> records.
  Per record: build & validate;
  skip + collect invalid rows,
  persist valid ones (one batch).
end note
System --> WP : import report (imported = N, skipped = M, reasons)
deactivate System

@enduml